1
00:00:03,020 --> 00:00:07,270
The intertwined fates of men give the Mononoke its Form.

2
00:00:07,570 --> 00:00:11,070
Enter the woman, protecting her child.

3
00:00:11,070 --> 00:00:15,530
Enter the mistress who gives the woman shelter for the night.

4
00:00:15,530 --> 00:00:19,330
Enter the man who seeks the woman.

5
00:00:19,330 --> 00:00:21,580
They all reside beneath the same roof.

6
00:00:21,580 --> 00:00:26,540
A splendid cast, set against the nightly
bustle, the splash of drink and the clatter of cups,

7
00:00:26,540 --> 00:00:30,050
and the innocent sound of children’s voices.

8
00:00:30,050 --> 00:00:36,590
Though the voices were clear, the children were
absent, except for the one in the woman’s womb.

9
00:00:36,590 --> 00:00:39,890
The Mononoke is most certainly a Zashikiwarashi,

10
00:00:40,640 --> 00:00:43,640
but where are the Truth and Regret?

11
00:01:13,460 --> 00:01:17,800
The blue moon illuminated

12
00:01:17,840 --> 00:01:21,760
your wandering shadow.

13
00:01:22,390 --> 00:01:26,270
I could never tell you all I wanted to say.

14
00:01:26,270 --> 00:01:31,190
It was so very frustrating.

15
00:01:31,270 --> 00:01:35,070
I think about your faked smile,

16
00:01:35,650 --> 00:01:39,700
and forget all the hot tears we shed.

17
00:01:40,160 --> 00:01:42,370
What do these empty husks,

18
00:01:42,410 --> 00:01:48,210
those empty eyes of yours, reflect, my dear?

19
00:01:48,960 --> 00:01:53,420
The transient quarter moon

20
00:01:53,800 --> 00:01:55,590
hides in a rift in the clouds,

21
00:01:55,550 --> 00:01:57,970
as darkness seeps up from the ground.

22
00:01:58,010 --> 00:02:02,430
Tell me the truth, please.

23
00:02:02,760 --> 00:02:04,600
Are you so despondent

24
00:02:04,680 --> 00:02:08,980
that you still sit alone, sighing?

25
00:02:09,480 --> 00:02:10,940
Part the Second

26
00:02:17,990 --> 00:02:22,700
There is something within this lodge.

27
00:02:31,080 --> 00:02:34,880
The pregnant girl and this inn…

28
00:02:33,790 --> 00:02:34,880
I’m sorry.

29
00:02:35,550 --> 00:02:38,840
I’ll protect you.

30
00:02:36,420 --> 00:02:38,840
Does this perhaps bring

31
00:02:39,630 --> 00:02:41,510
I’m sorry!

32
00:02:41,180 --> 00:02:42,390
anything to mind?

33
00:02:41,510 --> 00:02:43,600
There, there.

34
00:02:48,100 --> 00:02:50,600
What of the man the Mononoke killed?

35
00:02:51,020 --> 00:02:52,400
Do you know him?

36
00:03:04,030 --> 00:03:07,830
The man’s name was Naosuke.

37
00:03:08,410 --> 00:03:09,410
He was an assassin.

38
00:03:10,660 --> 00:03:11,710
Why was he here?

39
00:03:13,250 --> 00:03:16,960
To kill me and my unborn child.

40
00:03:15,710 --> 00:03:16,960
Sh—She was serious about that?

41
00:03:16,960 --> 00:03:19,220
Sh—She was serious about that?

42
00:03:19,220 --> 00:03:20,170
Who sent him?

43
00:03:21,880 --> 00:03:23,760
My master and mistress.

44
00:03:23,760 --> 00:03:24,800
Why?

45
00:03:26,430 --> 00:03:29,890
Because its father is their heir.

46
00:03:29,890 --> 00:03:31,020
It was an unallowable—

47
00:03:31,020 --> 00:03:32,310
Relationship.

48
00:03:35,150 --> 00:03:38,650
But they did allow it!

49
00:03:38,650 --> 00:03:39,900
Good lord.

50
00:03:39,900 --> 00:03:42,570
They just suddenly said it couldn’t be, that it was forbidden!

51
00:03:40,990 --> 00:03:41,950
Idiot.

52
00:03:41,950 --> 00:03:42,570
Stupid girl.

53
00:03:42,570 --> 00:03:44,410
Stupid girl.

54
00:03:44,410 --> 00:03:46,120
I didn’t want their property!

55
00:03:45,240 --> 00:03:47,160
So naive.

56
00:03:46,120 --> 00:03:48,330
I promised the young master!

57
00:03:48,330 --> 00:03:51,750
I just wanted to give birth!

58
00:03:51,750 --> 00:03:52,540
That’s all!

59
00:03:59,880 --> 00:04:02,720
God, you’re so annoying!

60
00:04:02,720 --> 00:04:05,680
I don’t care if it’s a Mononoke or a ghost, or what, I…

61
00:04:10,770 --> 00:04:13,690
If there’s something in this house,

62
00:04:13,690 --> 00:04:16,440
then why don’t we just leave?

63
00:04:23,280 --> 00:04:24,490
How the…

64
00:04:24,490 --> 00:04:25,660
What…

65
00:04:25,660 --> 00:04:27,120
Huh?

66
00:04:31,870 --> 00:04:32,870
My goodness.

67
00:04:38,380 --> 00:04:41,210
What on Earth is going on?

68
00:05:20,960 --> 00:05:22,340
Mother.

69
00:05:52,330 --> 00:05:53,870
It stinks.

70
00:06:19,560 --> 00:06:20,690
People?

71
00:06:38,080 --> 00:06:39,210
I’m sorry!

72
00:07:04,150 --> 00:07:04,940
What is

73
00:07:05,940 --> 00:07:07,320
this?

74
00:07:21,620 --> 00:07:26,750
Just where is this?

75
00:07:37,220 --> 00:07:40,980
This will be difficult.

76
00:07:41,020 --> 00:07:43,600
How can you be so relaxed?

77
00:07:43,600 --> 00:07:47,110
Do something about this!

78
00:08:00,500 --> 00:08:01,660
It’s gone?

79
00:08:06,590 --> 00:08:07,840
This way.

80
00:08:08,960 --> 00:08:09,920
It’s coming.

81
00:08:43,290 --> 00:08:45,670
It’s gone again.

82
00:09:03,770 --> 00:09:09,230
You’re the one who refuses to talk, ma’am.

83
00:09:09,230 --> 00:09:10,230
Now…

84
00:09:23,040 --> 00:09:28,960
This room was made as an offering to the dead.

85
00:09:41,510 --> 00:09:43,850
What do you mean, an offering?

86
00:09:46,770 --> 00:09:50,110
It was all I could do for them.

87
00:09:50,110 --> 00:09:52,900
All you could do?

88
00:09:52,900 --> 00:09:56,610
This house was once a brothel.

89
00:10:02,330 --> 00:10:05,040
Where is this, ma’am?

90
00:10:07,040 --> 00:10:09,460
This is the abortion room.

91
00:10:10,500 --> 00:10:13,210
It’s a grave for all the children produced.

92
00:10:15,920 --> 00:10:17,840
We were doing them a favor.

93
00:10:21,180 --> 00:10:22,680
What’s wrong with that?

94
00:10:22,680 --> 00:10:23,220
What?

95
00:10:28,560 --> 00:10:29,350
Huh?

96
00:10:40,660 --> 00:10:43,870
Shino?

97
00:10:44,740 --> 00:10:47,790
Shino, I love you.

98
00:10:52,000 --> 00:10:53,500
The young master,

99
00:10:53,960 --> 00:10:55,250
and myself?

100
00:10:58,220 --> 00:11:00,680
Shino, I love you.

101
00:11:01,430 --> 00:11:03,180
I love you.

102
00:11:04,100 --> 00:11:07,560
I am your servant.

103
00:11:07,560 --> 00:11:09,100
I love you.

104
00:11:10,440 --> 00:11:14,190
The master and mistress will not allow it.

105
00:11:14,190 --> 00:11:15,820
I love you.

106
00:11:15,820 --> 00:11:16,900
Let us marry!

107
00:11:19,650 --> 00:11:21,530
Marry?

108
00:11:21,530 --> 00:11:22,280
Are you sure?

109
00:11:22,280 --> 00:11:24,990
I don’t care what happens.

110
00:11:24,990 --> 00:11:26,200
Really?

111
00:11:26,580 --> 00:11:29,580
Really. You’re all I need.

112
00:11:33,290 --> 00:11:34,500
Oh, really?

113
00:11:36,500 --> 00:11:38,460
Then I can tell you.

114
00:11:38,460 --> 00:11:39,760
What is it?

115
00:11:39,760 --> 00:11:41,590
What can you tell me?

116
00:11:41,590 --> 00:11:43,890
I…

117
00:11:43,890 --> 00:11:47,430
I am carrying your child.

118
00:11:47,810 --> 00:11:49,180
Huh?

119
00:11:50,270 --> 00:11:51,440
Is that so?

120
00:11:55,360 --> 00:11:59,150
You’ll sleep with anyone who has money, right?

121
00:12:07,490 --> 00:12:09,790
What a stupid girl.

122
00:12:09,790 --> 00:12:12,250
Right, Tokuji?

123
00:12:14,210 --> 00:12:14,790
Yup.

124
00:12:34,730 --> 00:12:36,190
Mother.

125
00:12:38,610 --> 00:12:40,150
Mother.

126
00:12:42,950 --> 00:12:43,780
Mother.

127
00:12:46,870 --> 00:12:49,330
How nice!

128
00:12:51,330 --> 00:12:53,040
I’ve decided.

129
00:12:53,040 --> 00:12:54,960
I’ll use these people.

130
00:12:59,710 --> 00:13:01,880
Congratulations!

131
00:13:05,930 --> 00:13:07,760
Thank you.

132
00:13:12,520 --> 00:13:15,940
I’ve finally got a mother.

133
00:13:28,450 --> 00:13:30,120
Goodness, what a nuisance!

134
00:13:30,120 --> 00:13:33,580
She seems so nice.

135
00:13:34,540 --> 00:13:37,960
If you can’t work, you’ll never pay off your debt.

136
00:13:37,960 --> 00:13:40,880
It’s no good hiding.

137
00:13:43,630 --> 00:13:47,470
You’re useless.

138
00:13:48,800 --> 00:13:53,060
If you can’t work, you don’t eat.
You’re whores, sold to pay a debt!

139
00:13:56,730 --> 00:14:01,520
You can’t do your job with a child in the works.

140
00:14:02,400 --> 00:14:03,690
Stop it.

141
00:14:04,570 --> 00:14:06,360
In order to survive…

142
00:14:07,200 --> 00:14:08,280
Stop it!

143
00:14:08,280 --> 00:14:10,740
I had no choice.

144
00:14:46,150 --> 00:14:48,780
You’re with child, are you?

145
00:14:48,780 --> 00:14:49,860
That’s

146
00:14:49,990 --> 00:14:51,570
no good.

147
00:14:52,780 --> 00:14:56,080
We’ll help you out.

148
00:14:56,950 --> 00:14:58,330
If it’s gone…

149
00:15:00,210 --> 00:15:02,920
The Zashikiwarashi won’t come after you!

150
00:15:03,590 --> 00:15:04,750
Stop it!

151
00:15:04,750 --> 00:15:07,550
The Zashikiwarashi wanted to be born!

152
00:15:07,550 --> 00:15:09,550
That’s why they came after you.

153
00:15:09,550 --> 00:15:11,220
Stop it!

154
00:15:14,850 --> 00:15:17,600
Don’t kill him!

155
00:15:28,110 --> 00:15:29,240
No.

156
00:15:55,600 --> 00:15:56,930
Medicine Seller?

157
00:15:55,600 --> 00:15:56,930
Those tied to this room were killed when this was a brothel.

158
00:15:56,930 --> 00:16:01,560
Those tied to this room were killed when this was a brothel.

159
00:16:01,560 --> 00:16:04,150
A child’s emotions.

160
00:16:05,400 --> 00:16:08,900
Now for the Regret. Just one more.

161
00:16:08,900 --> 00:16:11,700
If I find the Regret, the sword can be drawn.

162
00:16:13,450 --> 00:16:15,240
What is it you want?

163
00:16:15,240 --> 00:16:16,370
Stop it!

164
00:16:16,370 --> 00:16:17,830
Don’t kill them!

165
00:16:17,830 --> 00:16:19,540
What did those poor children do to you?

166
00:16:20,750 --> 00:16:25,250
This is a Mononoke. It wishes to burst forth from your belly.

167
00:16:25,250 --> 00:16:27,750
It just wants to live in this world!

168
00:16:27,750 --> 00:16:31,090
But it cannot.

169
00:16:34,010 --> 00:16:35,050
Come here.

170
00:16:37,350 --> 00:16:40,060
I’ll give birth to you, as well.

171
00:16:49,610 --> 00:16:52,400
You wish to give birth to the Mononoke?

172
00:16:54,450 --> 00:16:58,740
All those within my womb are my children.

173
00:17:05,710 --> 00:17:07,460
Stop it.

174
00:17:07,460 --> 00:17:09,290
You’ll be sucked in.

175
00:17:12,130 --> 00:17:15,630
I will give birth to my child.

176
00:17:21,930 --> 00:17:22,930
That’s all I want.

177
00:17:27,400 --> 00:17:28,560
Why?

178
00:17:41,120 --> 00:17:43,040
Congratulations!

179
00:17:44,000 --> 00:17:47,210
I like this one!

180
00:17:48,750 --> 00:17:51,710
She always strokes me.

181
00:17:51,710 --> 00:17:53,050
So kind.

182
00:17:54,510 --> 00:17:55,720
So kind.

183
00:17:56,550 --> 00:17:57,760
So kind.

184
00:17:58,800 --> 00:18:00,050
So kind.

185
00:18:01,510 --> 00:18:02,390
So kind.

186
00:18:03,930 --> 00:18:05,100
So kind.

187
00:18:06,100 --> 00:18:07,310
So kind.

188
00:18:08,190 --> 00:18:09,310
So kind.

189
00:18:25,080 --> 00:18:26,790
I’m glad it was her.

190
00:18:28,460 --> 00:18:32,500
I’m sorry I had to hurt you so.

191
00:18:33,340 --> 00:18:38,220
Thank you for always trying your best.

192
00:18:39,800 --> 00:18:46,430
Thank you for talking to me so much.

193
00:18:47,020 --> 00:18:51,020
I love you.

194
00:18:54,020 --> 00:18:56,780
I love you.

195
00:18:59,700 --> 00:19:02,530
I love

196
00:19:02,530 --> 00:19:03,950
you.

197
00:19:11,500 --> 00:19:14,420
You’re welcome.

198
00:19:14,420 --> 00:19:24,010
Thank you for choosing me, for coming to me.

199
00:19:30,560 --> 00:19:36,610
I’m sorry. I could not be your mother.

200
00:19:36,610 --> 00:19:38,190
We can’t be together.

201
00:19:50,080 --> 00:19:51,370
I…

202
00:20:26,700 --> 00:20:34,210
Without you, I just can’t smile.

203
00:20:35,330 --> 00:20:45,260
I walk this banal town,

204
00:20:45,260 --> 00:20:51,350
feeling such intense emotions.

205
00:20:51,890 --> 00:20:57,730
I know that if I could treasure them and live on,

206
00:20:57,810 --> 00:21:07,030
I would need nothing else.

207
00:21:07,700 --> 00:21:15,210
The summer flowers that bloomed in the sky

208
00:21:15,210 --> 00:21:21,500
Come falling down, dancing in the wind.

209
00:21:21,590 --> 00:21:24,840
I can barely recall the night sky

210
00:21:24,840 --> 00:21:28,140
where they all came tumbling down,

211
00:21:28,140 --> 00:21:38,980
so what I can still recall is all the more precious.

212
00:21:46,740 --> 00:21:49,820
There, there. There, there.

213
00:22:01,540 --> 00:22:04,800
Well, I never did eat, did I?

214
00:22:10,720 --> 00:22:13,560
Are you sure I should be your mother?

215
00:22:17,350 --> 00:22:20,980
I hope to see you soon.

216
00:22:22,610 --> 00:22:29,990
The End
